  Entries:
  - StartHour: 6
    StationId: station.st_peters.sage_dooryard
    Activity: 0
    Why: "out early \u2014 through the same door Basil left by an hour before him,
      and Basil is still a speck away up the island when he does it"
  - StartHour: 6.5
    StationId: station.st_peters.flats_head
    Activity: 1
    Why: west on the painted dirt to the head of the flats, and digs
  - StartHour: 12
    StationId: station.st_peters.store_customer_b
    Activity: 2
    Why: "the long walk in for his dinner \u2014 the middle slot at the counter"
  - StartHour: 14.5
    StationId: station.st_peters.flats_head
    Activity: 1
    Why: back out west for the afternoon tide
  - StartHour: 19
    StationId: station.st_peters.green_d
    Activity: 3
    Why: in off the flats to the green
  - StartHour: 21
    StationId: station.st_peters.home_sage_a
    Activity: 0
    Why: in, one side of the doorway lane
  WalkSpeedMetresPerSecond: 1.35
  ScheduleJitterMinutes: 7
  WeeklyDays:
  - Weekday: 2
    Why: "Wednesday is his run to Nine Mile Creek on the quad: over the bar in the
      morning for fuel and the week's order, back for a late dinner, then the
      afternoon tide as any day"
